፥","poem":1},{"text":"ጉየፐ አጋናዉ ዳንዳአካ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"heading","content":["3"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"text":"አሳ አጮ ታ ቃንፃና ጋዳ","poem":1},{"text":"ዋሰ ግዶፓ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"ነ ቃንፅያባ ይኮ፥","poem":1},{"text":"ነ ዝንእያ ሂፃይ አቶና፥","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ነዉ ደእያባ ኡባይ ኤከታና።","poem":2}]},{"type":"heading","content":["4"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"ነ ማይዛት ቶክዳ","poem":1},{"text":"በን ዛዋ ሾዶፋ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"heading","content":["5"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"text":"ባ ኦሱዋን ሎህዳ አስ በአዲ?","poem":1},{"text":"እ ጮ አሳታስ ግዶናሽን ካዎታስ ኦስ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gof_etw/PRO/22.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/PRO/23.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/PRO/21.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}